{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b00408db724b7cf0829b08d7a430e22ba3ce56617f17907b9ad54972745c3cb9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4491b2dc694212a2611e782f95a8369d1462ead78ff5cc979f823a98c0785f46",
      "text": "喂，制作人？\n现在方便通电话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8e6d5b95821e17429a722bd17d1d06409e8eb0bfc6f55f2a333f7e3c59b3d27",
      "text": "今天的派对真的特别开心哦。\n听说制作人也帮了许多忙呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e9988de28c1d7ef88071cbe156cfb6813bf757579b7ef72db6198641845175f",
      "text": "工作肯定也很忙碌吧，真是谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58ce46179c92f346d39887f17d1ce6170ee8a0b0b73862ec792dc85b32c25748",
      "text": "恭二和皮埃尔为我做的插花，\n想必也经过了反复练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e77fa3c6fe6becba27afdea5ae97c398dcf31c45024f36ec22a9edbc327b19d4",
      "text": "是的。为了练习\n还专门跑去了店里",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1274e856588b3a11fb87531fc6ca3cb48c768ef4ed15e7f45d4ca6c54846779e",
      "text": "他们说着全是为了实先生，\n非常努力呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3de1d7e451da1132ef289d2348d5c2d6a7c1d7fecda72fc589aa8dd3c8a792d6",
      "text": "呵呵，肯定是这样呢。\n我一看到那个作品就立刻明白了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d80bbce4cee4f9fdc838bd676a025b647e728429d3223405f2e9c5fa4e0ec90e",
      "text": "两个人一朵朵精心挑选、亲手制作的，\n世上独一无二的插花。……我真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b6284f8ff2039fe1b33a10773c541c0b272bb94f30c789b2f83ecc99b7614d9",
      "text": "因为想一直好好珍藏，\n我打算把这些花做成干花呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64dd7beadba5622abc3f38c998e257f1fdc9ef0a6e7d119403a53a45ee2809fa",
      "text": "等做好了，\n请务必给我看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:353355a035bca7b1d4efca45d17566952bb2464b56cd37ef222cfef408d5b0e2",
      "text": "那当然啦！到时候我会把照片发给你的。\n毕竟制作人也帮了不少忙嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ab5dc49178aa96da7b16bbbea320f0b65a70d9e8abe84559f0133a637329396",
      "text": "本来只是想打电话道声谢的，\n结果不知不觉聊了这么多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_22_t01:1_2_011_22_t01:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2fde8690d833d045f833190671ab4092db82c86c6f031d36bd40680242fceae",
      "text": "我差不多该挂啦。回头再联络哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
